{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#def:ancient-solution","title":"def:ancient-solution","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions.md","line":38,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions.tex#def:ancient-solution","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_BasicsOfRicciFlow#def:ricci-flow]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#def:kappa-noncollapsed]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions.tex","label":"def:ancient-solution","line":37,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Ancient solution and $\\kappa$-solution]\\label{def:ancient-solution}\n\\uses{def:ricci-flow, def:kappa-noncollapsed}\n\nAn \\emph{ancient solution} is a Ricci flow $(M,g(t))$,\n$-\\infty<t\\leq0$, such that every time-slice is connected, complete,\nnon-flat, and has bounded nonnegative curvature operator. A\n\\emph{$\\kappa$-solution} is an ancient solution that is\n$\\kappa$-non-collapsed on all scales.\n\\end{definition}\n\nA $\\kappa$-solution is also a $\\kappa'$-solution for\n$0<\\kappa'\\leq\\kappa$.","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Ancient solution and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>-solution]<span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a616e6369656e742d736f6c7574696f6e\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_BasicsOfRicciFlow%23def%3Aricci-flow\">↗ def:ricci-flow</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh09_KappaAncientSolutions%23def%3Akappa-noncollapsed\">↗ def:kappa-noncollapsed</a> <p></p>An <em>ancient solution</em> is a Ricci flow <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(M,g(t))$\">$(M,g(t))$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$-\\infty &lt;t\\leq 0$\">$-\\infty &lt;t\\leq 0$</span>, such that every time-slice is connected, complete, non-flat, and has bounded nonnegative curvature operator. A <em><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>-solution</em> is an ancient solution that is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>-non-collapsed on all scales.  <p></p>A <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>-solution is also a <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa &#x27;$\">$\\kappa &#x27;$</span>-solution for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0&lt;\\kappa &#x27;\\leq \\kappa $\">$0&lt;\\kappa &#x27;\\leq \\kappa $</span>.","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#kappadefn","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#ex:shrinking-sphere-kappa-solution","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_BasicsOfRicciFlow#def:ricci-flow","title":"def:ricci-flow","label":"def:ricci-flow"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#def:kappa-noncollapsed","title":"def:kappa-noncollapsed","label":"def:kappa-noncollapsed"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#ex:shrinking-sphere-kappa-solution","title":"ex:shrinking-sphere-kappa-solution","label":"ex:shrinking-sphere-kappa-solution"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#thm:two-dimensional-kappa-solution-preview","title":"thm:two-dimensional-kappa-solution-preview","label":"thm:two-dimensional-kappa-solution-preview"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#ex:round-sphere-quotient-kappa-solution","title":"ex:round-sphere-quotient-kappa-solution","label":"ex:round-sphere-quotient-kappa-solution"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#ex:cylinder-kappa-solution","title":"ex:cylinder-kappa-solution","label":"ex:cylinder-kappa-solution"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#ex:cylinder-quotient-kappa-solution","title":"ex:cylinder-quotient-kappa-solution","label":"ex:cylinder-quotient-kappa-solution"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#ex:cylinder-with-circle-not-kappa-noncollapsed","title":"ex:cylinder-with-circle-not-kappa-noncollapsed","label":"ex:cylinder-with-circle-not-kappa-noncollapsed"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#thm:asymptotic-gradient-shrinking-soliton","title":"thm:asymptotic-gradient-shrinking-soliton","label":"thm:asymptotic-gradient-shrinking-soliton"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#prop:asymptotic-scalar-curvature-infinite","title":"prop:asymptotic-scalar-curvature-infinite","label":"prop:asymptotic-scalar-curvature-infinite"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#thm:asymptotic-volume-zero","title":"thm:asymptotic-volume-zero","label":"thm:asymptotic-volume-zero"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#thm:kappa-solution-compactness","title":"thm:kappa-solution-compactness","label":"thm:kappa-solution-compactness"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_KappaAncientSolutions#prop:kappa-solution-trichotomy","title":"prop:kappa-solution-trichotomy","label":